sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User (Browser)
    participant WebCtrl as ChatsController (Web App)
    participant Svc as ConversationService
    participant Proxy as ConversationAPIProxy
    participant APICtrl as ConversationController (API)
    participant Repo as ConversationRepository (DB)

    User->>WebCtrl: POST /Chats/SendMessage (convoId, text)
    
    
    WebCtrl->>Svc: Initialize(senderId)
    WebCtrl->>Svc: FetchConversations()
    Svc-->>WebCtrl: List<ConversationDTO>
    WebCtrl->>WebCtrl: Find Receiver ID from Participants

    
    WebCtrl->>WebCtrl: Create MessageDataTransferObject (DTO)
    WebCtrl->>Svc: SendMessage(DTO)
    Svc->>Svc: Convert DTO to Message Entity

   
    Svc->>Proxy: HandleNewMessage(Message)
    Proxy->>Proxy: Convert Message to MessageDto
    Proxy->>APICtrl: POST api/Conversation/messages (JSON)

   
    APICtrl->>APICtrl: Convert MessageDto to Message Entity
    APICtrl->>Repo: HandleNewMessage(Message)
    Repo->>Repo: Save to SQL Database
    Repo-->>APICtrl: Return Persisted Message (with new ID)


    APICtrl->>APICtrl: Convert to MessageDto
    APICtrl-->>Proxy: 200 OK (MessageDto JSON)
    Proxy->>Proxy: Convert back to Message Entity
    Proxy-->>Svc: Return Persisted Message
    Svc->>Svc: Update Local Cached Conversations
    Svc->>Svc: NotifySubscribersAboutMessage()
    Svc-->>WebCtrl: Task Completed
    WebCtrl-->>User: 200 OK (AJAX Success)
    
    User->>WebCtrl: AJAX triggers loadMessages() UI Refresh